      "content": "It sounds like you are in immense pain, and that feeling of being a burden is a terrible weight to carry. The idea of disappearing, though it feels like a way to protect her, is a permanent solution to temporary, though overwhelming, pain. Please know that your life has value, and there are ways to find relief that don't involve ending your own. If you are feeling this intensely, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately.",
